PracticeItems.Prompt:
What is printed by the following code?

for (int i = 1; i <= 3; i++) {
    for (int j = 1; j <= 2; j++) {
        System.out.print(i * j + " ");
    }
}

How many total times does the innermost print statement execute in this nested loop?

for (int i = 0; i < 4; i++) {
    for (int j = 0; j < 3; j++) {
        System.out.println("x");
    }
}

Consider this nested loop meant to print a pattern of stars, one row per value of i, with i+1 stars per row for i from 0 to 2:

for (int i = 0; i < 3; i++) {
    for (int j = 0; j <= i; j++) {
        System.out.print("*");
    }
    System.out.println();
}

What is printed?
